# Portable SSH client hardening/defaults, included from ~/.ssh/config by
# ssh/setup.sh. Host-specific entries (real hostnames, IPs, usernames)
# belong directly in ~/.ssh/config itself, ABOVE the Include line -- never
# in this repo, since ssh_config resolves each parameter to its FIRST
# match, so specific Host blocks must appear before this catch-all to win.
#
# Deliberately does not pin Ciphers/KexAlgorithms/MACs -- OpenSSH's
# compiled-in defaults are already strong and get updated with the OS;
# hardcoding a list here would only go stale and risk breaking compatibility
# down the line.

Host *
  AddKeysToAgent yes
  IdentitiesOnly yes
  HashKnownHosts yes
  ServerAliveInterval 60
  ServerAliveCountMax 3
  ControlMaster auto
  ControlPath ~/.ssh/sockets/%r@%h-%p
  ControlPersist 10m
